      <title>ITG CFO: We're the Picks &amp; Shovels of the AI Boom</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-08-21/itg-cfo-we-re-the-picks-shovels-of-the-ai-boom-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">72b120d611f57a05d201217c</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:35:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Chris Mecray, CFO at ITG, joins Bloomberg Businessweek Daily to discuss the company's performance since its July 1 IPO, and its role in the AI buildout as a fiber and communications company. Mecray says ITG is "the picks and shovels of the AI boom... with a long runway of opportunity associated with creating the connectivity that data centers require once the actual site itself is built." Mecray speaks with Carol Massar, Emily Graffeo, and Nina Trentmann, CFO Briefing Editor. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
